# Dashboard version history (required)

For any PR that changes running product behavior (frontend UI, backend API,
market updater, trading/Telegram paths that ship to AWS), append a new entry to
`VERSION_HISTORY` in `frontend/src/app/page.tsx` before opening/updating the PR:

- Bump version (e.g. `0.47` → `0.48`)
- Include date, short `change` summary, and `details` with what/why + PR numbers
- Header badge `v{version}` and Version History tab (newest first) are the
  operator-facing changelog

Skip only for pure docs/chore PRs that never affect the running dashboard.
See `AGENTS.md` → "Dashboard version history".
